---
/*
 * DRAFT TERMS OF SERVICE: NOT LEGAL ADVICE.
 * Terms of use for this website (not a client contract: engagements are
 * governed by a separate written proposal or agreement). Written for South
 * Africa: the Consumer Protection Act (CPA) and the Electronic Communications
 * and Transactions Act (ECTA, incl. the section 43 disclosures). The final
 * text needs review by the client and, ideally, a legal professional before
 * launch. Company facts come from src/data/site.ts and show as visible
 * placeholders until supplied.
 */
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import Fact from '../components/legal/Fact.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { url } from '../lib/url';

const { legal, contact, policies } = site;

const sections = [
  { id: 'about', title: 'About these terms' },
  { id: 'legal-information', title: 'Legal information' },
  { id: 'using-the-site', title: 'Using this website' },
  { id: 'content', title: 'Information on this website' },
  { id: 'work-with-us', title: 'Quotes and client work' },
  { id: 'intellectual-property', title: 'Intellectual property' },
  { id: 'messages', title: 'Messages you send us' },
  { id: 'links', title: 'Links to other websites' },
  { id: 'availability', title: 'Availability and changes' },
  { id: 'liability', title: 'Liability' },
  { id: 'privacy', title: 'Privacy' },
  { id: 'law', title: 'Governing law' },
  { id: 'changes', title: 'Changes to these terms' },
  { id: 'contact', title: 'Contact' },
];
---

<LegalPage
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms for using The Connect Digital's website."
  effective={policies.termsEffective}
  sections={sections}
>
  <p slot="intro" class="mt-8 max-w-[44rem] text-lead text-muted">
    These terms apply when you use this website. Please read them; by using the site you agree to them.
  </p>

  <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
    <h2 id="about-h">About these terms</h2>
    <p>
      This website is run by {site.name} ("we", "us"). These terms cover your use of the website only. Any work we do
      for you is governed by a separate written proposal or agreement, which takes priority over these terms if they
      differ.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nothing in these terms limits any right you have under the Consumer Protection Act, 2008, or any other law that
      can't be excluded by agreement.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="legal-information" aria-labelledby="legal-information-h">
    <h2 id="legal-information-h">Legal information</h2>
    <p>As required by section 43 of the Electronic Communications and Transactions Act, 2002:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Full name: <Fact value={legal.registeredName} />, trading as {site.name}</li>
      <li>Legal status: <Fact value={legal.legalStatus} /></li>
      <li>Registration number: <Fact value={legal.registrationNumber} /></li>
      <li>Physical address (and address for legal notices): <Fact value={legal.registeredAddress} /></li>
      <li>Email: <Fact value={contact.email} email /></li>
      <li>Telephone: <Fact value={contact.phone} /></li>
      <li>Website: {site.url.replace(/^https:\/\//, '')}</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="using-the-site" aria-labelledby="using-the-site-h">
    <h2 id="using-the-site-h">Using this website</h2>
    <p>You're welcome to browse and share this website. Please don't:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>use it for anything unlawful, or to send spam or harmful material;</li>
      <li>try to gain unauthorised access to it, interfere with how it works, or overload it;</li>
      <li>copy large parts of it, or use automated tools to scrape it, without our permission;</li>
      <li>pretend to be someone else when you contact us.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="content" aria-labelledby="content-h">
    <h2 id="content-h">Information on this website</h2>
    <p>
      The information here describes our services in general terms. It isn't professional advice for your particular
      situation, and it isn't an offer we're bound by: what we'll do, and at what price, is set out in a written
      proposal.
    </p>
    <p>
      We try to keep the site accurate and up to date, but we can't guarantee that everything on it is complete or
      current at all times.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="work-with-us" aria-labelledby="work-with-us-h">
    <h2 id="work-with-us-h">Quotes and client work</h2>
    <p>
      Sending an enquiry doesn't create a contract. If we agree to work together, we'll confirm the scope, timeline,
      fees and terms in writing before any work starts, and that agreement will govern the project.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="intellectual-property" aria-labelledby="intellectual-property-h">
    <h2 id="intellectual-property-h">Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The content of this website, including its text, design, graphics and our logo, belongs to us or to the people
      who licensed it to us, and is protected by copyright and trade mark law. You may view it and share links to it,
      but you may not reuse it commercially without our written permission.
    </p>
    <p>
      Other names and logos shown on this website are the trade marks of their respective owners.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="messages" aria-labelledby="messages-h">
    <h2 id="messages-h">Messages you send us</h2>
    <p>
      When you contact us, please make sure the information you give is accurate and that you're entitled to share
      it. Don't send confidential information until we've agreed how it will be handled. We use what you send as our{' '}
      <a href={url('/privacy')}>Privacy Policy</a> describes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="links" aria-labelledby="links-h">
    <h2 id="links-h">Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>
      Links to other websites, including social media, are there for convenience. We don't control those sites and
      aren't responsible for their content or how they handle your information; their own terms and privacy policies
      apply.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="availability" aria-labelledby="availability-h">
    <h2 id="availability-h">Availability and changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update, change or take down any part of the website at any time. We aim to keep it available, but we
      don't promise it will always be available or free of errors.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="liability" aria-labelledby="liability-h">
    <h2 id="liability-h">Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the extent the law allows, we're not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or inability to
      use, this website or from relying on its general information. This doesn't exclude liability that can't be
      excluded by law, including under the Consumer Protection Act, or liability for our gross negligence or wilful
      misconduct.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-h">
    <h2 id="privacy-h">Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      How we collect and use personal information, and your rights under POPIA, are explained in our{' '}
      <a href={url('/privacy')}>Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="law" aria-labelledby="law-h">
    <h2 id="law-h">Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These terms are governed by the law of the Republic of South Africa, and South African courts have jurisdiction
      over any dispute about them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="changes" aria-labelledby="changes-h">
    <h2 id="changes-h">Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms from time to time. The effective date at the top shows when they last changed. The
      version on this page when you use the site is the one that applies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-h">
    <h2 id="contact-h">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms? Email us at <Fact value={contact.email} email /> or use the{' '}
      <a href={url('/connect')}>contact form</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
